      ],
      "source": "https://yehud-monosson.muni.il/en/about/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Neve Monosson, a communal settlement within Yehud, was founded in 1955 and grew to about 3,000 residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://yehud-monosson.muni.il/en/about/history/",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Yehud shifted from an agricultural community to a residential and light‑industrial hub by the 1960s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
