      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/israel/central-district_yehud",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In 2003, Yehud and Neve Monosson merged to form the unified Yehud‑Monosson Municipality.",
